.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SPRINT CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik sprint create \- Create a sprint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik sprint create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a sprint
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
Sprint name
.TP
.B --start-date
Planned start date (RFC 3339)
.TP
.B --end-date
Planned end date (RFC 3339)
.TP
.B --goal
Sprint goal
.TP
.B --target-points
Target story-point total
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
